      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Job dr_models_cdc. Scheduled every 15 min in WEST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17) (PAUSED for POC -> UNPAUSED to go live). Detects deltas by version watermark + metadata signature, pulls ONLY changed versions/metadata via dr_remote_east, appends (delete_model=False). Then a health check fails the run on drift.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job dr_models_cdc. Scheduled every 15 min in WEST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17) (PAUSED for POC -> UNPAUSED to go live). Detects deltas by version watermark + metadata signature, pulls ONLY changed versions/metadata via dr_remote_east, appends (delete_model=False). Then a health check fails the run on drift.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 12
    },
