      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Scheduled fire (cron every 15 min, UTC) OR optional near-real-time Model Update Trigger (MODEL_VERSION_READY / MODEL_ALIAS_SET). Runs 03_cdc.py in WEST.",
