      "text": "2. changefeed.detect_changes: read SOURCE registry (ambient=EAST via dr_remote_east); for each model compare source max version vs dr_object_inventory.last_source_version AND recompute metadata signature vs stored.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. changefeed.detect_changes: read SOURCE registry (ambient=EAST via dr_remote_east); for each model compare source max version vs dr_object_inventory.last_source_version AND recompute metadata signature vs stored.",
