      "text": "Job     : dr_models_cdc   (tasks: cdc -> health_check)\nCron    : 0 0/15 * * * ?   (every 15 min, UTC)   var.cdc_schedule_cron\nStatus  : PAUSED for POC  ->  deploy --var cdc_pause_status=UNPAUSED to go live\nRuns in : WEST (secondary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nOptional: near-real-time Model Update Trigger (MODEL_VERSION_READY | MODEL_ALIAS_SET,\n          min_time_between_triggers_seconds=300) fires within seconds of a PRIMARY change.\nSafety  : dr_models_health scans hourly (0 0 * * * ?) even if a CDC run never fired.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job     : dr_models_cdc   (tasks: cdc -> health_check)\nCron    : 0 0/15 * * * ?   (every 15 min, UTC)   var.cdc_schedule_cron\nStatus  : PAUSED for POC  ->  deploy --var cdc_pause_status=UNPAUSED to go live\nRuns in : WEST (secondary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nOptional: near-real-time Model Update Trigger (MODEL_VERSION_READY | MODEL_ALIAS_SET,\n          min_time_between_triggers_seconds=300) fires within seconds of a PRIMARY change.\nSafety  : dr_models_health scans hourly (0 0 * * * ?) even if a CDC run never fired.",
